1
00:01:00,325 --> 00:01:02,208
Hubby, save me!

2
00:01:07,411 --> 00:01:09,007
Lin Zai!

3
00:01:49,541 --> 00:01:50,791
Brother!

4
00:01:50,791 --> 00:01:52,708
- Help!
- Lin Zai!

5
00:01:52,708 --> 00:01:54,291
It's not possible! This way!

6
00:01:54,291 --> 00:01:56,133
Quick! Go!

7
00:02:11,875 --> 00:02:14,455
Hurry up, Lin Zai!

8
00:02:15,583 --> 00:02:16,666
This way!

9
00:02:16,666 --> 00:02:18,133
Over here!

10
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,416
This way!

11
00:02:20,416 --> 00:02:22,633
Up! Up!

12
00:02:24,291 --> 00:02:26,216
Brother, it won't open!

13
00:02:32,166 --> 00:02:34,758
Brother! The door's open, quick!

14
00:02:56,166 --> 00:02:57,875
You bastard.

15
00:02:57,875 --> 00:03:00,333
It's not safe for us to be here.

16
00:03:00,333 --> 00:03:03,133
We must hurry and find a new exit.

17
00:03:04,373 --> 00:03:08,375
I just saw the floor plan in the hallway.

18
00:03:08,375 --> 00:03:10,791
I know where the exit is.

19
00:03:10,791 --> 00:03:12,125
Brother.

20
00:03:12,125 --> 00:03:15,462
Don't worry, I will definitely get you out.

21
00:03:16,375 --> 00:03:17,833
If you say it'll happen,

22
00:03:17,833 --> 00:03:19,416
then it'll definitely happen!

23
00:03:19,416 --> 00:03:20,675
Come on!

24
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,591
Lin Zai!

25
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:35,925
Brother!

26
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,383
Go! You must live on!

27
00:03:41,541 --> 00:03:42,833
Go!

28
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:46,300
Let me be!

29
00:03:54,541 --> 00:03:56,633
Brother...

30
00:03:58,708 --> 00:04:03,258
Live on...

31
00:05:15,375 --> 00:05:17,750
<i>My name is Lin Zai.</i>

32
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:19,458
<i>22 days ago,</i>

33
00:05:19,458 --> 00:05:22,125
<i>the zombie crisis broke out.</i>

34
00:05:22,125 --> 00:05:24,208
<i>It destroyed my life,</i>

35
00:05:24,208 --> 00:05:26,050
<i>and took away my parents.</i>

36
00:05:27,375 --> 00:05:28,875
<i>Just now,</i>

37
00:05:28,875 --> 00:05:30,800
<i>it took away my last family.</i>

38
00:05:31,833 --> 00:05:35,000
<i>Now, I've been bitten, too.</i>

39
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,841
<i>It's all over.</i>

40
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,625
<i>They say,</i>

41
00:05:39,625 --> 00:05:42,966
<i>after being bitten,
you can stay awake for a few hours at most.</i>

42
00:05:44,208 --> 00:05:45,958
<i>It hurts this much.</i>

43
00:05:45,958 --> 00:05:47,341
<i>And it's so cold.</i>

44
00:05:48,083 --> 00:05:50,508
<i>You'll slowly forget who you are.</i>

45
00:05:52,125 --> 00:05:54,208
<i>I'm probably...</i>

46
00:05:54,208 --> 00:05:56,050
<i>on my way to the end.</i>

47
00:06:52,708 --> 00:06:54,375
Hubby, are you okay?

48
00:06:54,375 --> 00:06:55,375
I'm fine.

49
00:06:55,375 --> 00:06:56,708
Your lips are all pale.

50
00:06:56,708 --> 00:06:57,958
I'm fine.

51
00:06:57,958 --> 00:06:59,000
Why are you sweating so much?

52
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,425
I'm good.

53
00:07:08,333 --> 00:07:10,416
Please! Don't kill me!

54
00:07:10,416 --> 00:07:12,125
Don't kill me! Please!

55
00:07:12,125 --> 00:07:13,333
- Please don't kill him!
- Please!

56
00:07:13,333 --> 00:07:14,925
- Please!
- Please!

57
00:07:19,333 --> 00:07:20,833
Hubby!

58
00:07:20,833 --> 00:07:22,291
- No immunogen found.
- Hubby!

59
00:07:22,291 --> 00:07:24,216
<i>Continue with the search.</i>

60
00:07:38,666 --> 00:07:40,675
I didn't turn into a zombie.

61
00:07:45,416 --> 00:07:47,966
<i>You must live on.</i>
[Fortune]

62
00:07:53,666 --> 00:07:55,250
Brother...

63
00:07:55,250 --> 00:07:57,708
I will definitely live on well.

64
00:07:57,708 --> 00:07:59,633
Even if it's just for one day.

65
00:09:44,867 --> 00:09:49,422
[Apocalypse Log 1]

66
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:58,083
[Six Months Later]

67
00:10:08,416 --> 00:10:10,375
Lin Zai, come here for a second.

68
00:10:10,375 --> 00:10:12,216
Okay. Coming.

69
00:10:17,083 --> 00:10:18,541
What's up, Li?

70
00:10:18,541 --> 00:10:20,958
I changed the bulb, why isn't it working?

71
00:10:20,958 --> 00:10:22,750
- Let me take a look.
- You gotta fix it quick.

72
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:24,041
Zombies got in last night.

73
00:10:24,041 --> 00:10:25,166
- Huh?
- Don't worry.

74
00:10:25,166 --> 00:10:26,916
Chen handled them all.

75
00:10:26,916 --> 00:10:27,916
Chen is the best.

76
00:10:27,916 --> 00:10:29,083
Here, give it to me.

77
00:10:29,083 --> 00:10:30,383
Careful now.

78
00:10:37,458 --> 00:10:39,258
Go on, try it.

79
00:10:40,416 --> 00:10:41,800
Awesome.

80
00:10:43,291 --> 00:10:45,583
- Come on, let's grab food.
- Okay.

81
00:10:45,583 --> 00:10:47,041
A college kid really can make things work.

82
00:10:47,041 --> 00:10:49,416
I only know how to
change light bulbs or fix faucets.

83
00:10:49,416 --> 00:10:50,500
For this kind of sophisticated work,

84
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:52,624
we still have to rely on you.

85
00:10:52,624 --> 00:10:53,625
- Li.
- Yeah?

86
00:10:53,625 --> 00:10:55,250
You're the one with super strength.

87
00:10:55,250 --> 00:10:57,916
Carrying me up
to the fifth floor without panting.

88
00:10:57,916 --> 00:10:59,125
At crucial moments,

89
00:10:59,125 --> 00:11:01,041
you are much more useful than me.

90
00:11:01,041 --> 00:11:02,083
You little bastard.

91
00:11:02,083 --> 00:11:04,750
Are you implying that
I'm all brawn and no brains?

92
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:05,916
- No, no.
- Next time when we carry supplies,

93
00:11:05,916 --> 00:11:07,125
you're carrying twice the load.

94
00:11:07,125 --> 00:11:08,375
Otherwise, don't bother coming back.

95
00:11:08,375 --> 00:11:09,916
And no food for you.

96
00:11:09,916 --> 00:11:11,416
I was just about to go in and call you.

97
00:11:11,416 --> 00:11:13,841
- Time to eat!
- Grandma Qiu, let me help.

98
00:11:15,541 --> 00:11:16,791
People need to eat.

99
00:11:16,791 --> 00:11:18,750
Only when you are fed will you be able to work.

100
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:23,008
Today, we have the sparrow meat
you've been craving.

101
00:11:25,375 --> 00:11:28,258
Don't rush, we'll eat together
when Chen's back.

102
00:11:29,958 --> 00:11:31,125
Where is Chen?

103
00:11:31,125 --> 00:11:32,541
Chen...

104
00:11:32,541 --> 00:11:34,375
Chen should be in the backyard.

105
00:11:34,375 --> 00:11:36,291
Then I'll go get her.

106
00:11:36,291 --> 00:11:37,508
Okay.

107
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:51,591
Chen, food's ready!

108
00:12:08,625 --> 00:12:11,041
Good thing you suggested
adding a few more defenses yesterday.

109
00:12:11,041 --> 00:12:14,790
Otherwise, we would've been
attacked last night.

110
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:15,875
I'm glad it's useful.

111
00:12:15,875 --> 00:12:17,841
But we still can't let our guard down.

112
00:12:20,166 --> 00:12:21,625
All done.

113
00:12:21,625 --> 00:12:22,833
Don't worry.

114
00:12:22,833 --> 00:12:24,375
Our camp's location is hidden.

115
00:12:24,375 --> 00:12:25,916
Just a zombie or two passing by occasionally.

116
00:12:25,916 --> 00:12:29,625
I'm very equipped to deal with them.

117
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:30,916
You're the best.

118
00:12:30,916 --> 00:12:32,625
I still have to check the other traps.

119
00:12:32,625 --> 00:12:34,000
You go eat first.

120
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,133
All right, be careful.

121
00:13:09,916 --> 00:13:11,508
Brother...

122
00:13:12,375 --> 00:13:16,041
You must be protecting me in heaven,
keeping me from turning into a zombie.

123
00:13:16,041 --> 00:13:17,916
Before that day comes,

124
00:13:17,916 --> 00:13:20,216
I promise I will live on well.

125
00:14:19,166 --> 00:14:20,458
Go!

126
00:14:20,458 --> 00:14:22,300
Let me be!

127
00:14:26,791 --> 00:14:29,258
<i>Go! Let me be!</i>

128
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:50,800
Don't touch him!

129
00:14:51,458 --> 00:14:52,583
What are you doing?

130
00:14:52,583 --> 00:14:54,920
What if he's a zombie?

131
00:15:11,708 --> 00:15:13,300
Looks like he's not infected.

132
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:20,091
Just some physical injuries and scrapes.

133
00:15:21,666 --> 00:15:23,833
Seems like he fell from somewhere.

134
00:15:23,833 --> 00:15:26,041
Probably has some internal injuries
and fractures, too.

135
00:15:26,041 --> 00:15:28,166
To be able to make it to our camp,

136
00:15:28,166 --> 00:15:31,050
He probably encountered
quite a few zombies along the way.

137
00:15:33,458 --> 00:15:35,082
Can he be saved?

138
00:15:35,082 --> 00:15:36,085
Hard to say.

139
00:15:36,085 --> 00:15:38,208
But it's best we don't get involved in this.

140
00:15:38,208 --> 00:15:40,750
Camp supplies are already low.

141
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:42,125
Look at his gear.

142
00:15:42,125 --> 00:15:44,750
It's hard to say
if he's an apocalyptic raider or not.

143
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:47,050
We have to prioritize the safety of our camp.

144
00:15:56,875 --> 00:15:58,708
Bro, I'm sorry.

145
00:15:58,708 --> 00:16:00,500
As much as we want to,

146
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:02,375
we really can't help.

147
00:16:02,375 --> 00:16:03,883
Sorry about this.

148
00:16:16,833 --> 00:16:18,083
Wow.

149
00:16:18,083 --> 00:16:19,466
Bandages.

150
00:16:20,875 --> 00:16:23,050
Such a big bundle of climbing rope.

151
00:16:25,666 --> 00:16:27,508
And a small flashlight.

152
00:16:28,416 --> 00:16:30,591
He's definitely not an ordinary person.

153
00:16:33,583 --> 00:16:34,625
Food.

154
00:16:34,625 --> 00:16:36,050
Tools.

155
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,958
All things our camp needs.

156
00:16:38,958 --> 00:16:40,000
Other than raiders,

157
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,333
probably no one would
carry such complete equipment

158
00:16:42,333 --> 00:16:44,383
while wandering outside.

159
00:16:51,375 --> 00:16:53,750
He really has everything.

160
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,541
But at a time like this,

161
00:16:55,541 --> 00:16:58,083
it's still better to be careful.

162
00:16:58,083 --> 00:17:02,750
After all, it took us a lot
to finally build up this camp.

163
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:05,166
Ugh. That's true.

164
00:17:05,166 --> 00:17:06,875
No matter what time it is,

165
00:17:06,875 --> 00:17:09,083
humans always find enemies in their own kind.

166
00:17:09,083 --> 00:17:12,258
<i>Humans always find enemies in their own kind.</i>

167
00:17:18,418 --> 00:17:20,583
All right. Stop overthinking it.

168
00:17:20,583 --> 00:17:22,502
Even in peaceful times,

169
00:17:22,502 --> 00:17:23,875
if someone collapses on the roadside,

170
00:17:23,875 --> 00:17:25,416
not everyone would be a Samaritan.

171
00:17:25,416 --> 00:17:26,958
Let alone now.

172
00:17:26,958 --> 00:17:28,333
Captain Chen's judgment isn't wrong.

173
00:17:28,333 --> 00:17:31,041
Your desire to save people isn't wrong either.

174
00:17:31,041 --> 00:17:33,466
I know. I just...

175
00:17:34,208 --> 00:17:36,875
Forget it. Let's not talk about him.

176
00:17:36,875 --> 00:17:38,500
What else is in there? Let me see.

177
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:39,541
Hey.

178
00:17:39,541 --> 00:17:41,041
This kid's toy.

179
00:17:41,041 --> 00:17:42,250
It's a bit too childish.

180
00:17:42,250 --> 00:17:44,541
Just right for a young college boy like you.

181
00:17:44,541 --> 00:17:46,091
It's yours.

182
00:17:48,372 --> 00:17:50,672
College boys find it childish, too.

183
00:17:51,875 --> 00:17:52,958
Well...

184
00:17:52,958 --> 00:17:54,375
Oh, how about this?

185
00:17:54,375 --> 00:17:55,841
This is a trendy watch.

186
00:18:00,875 --> 00:18:02,875
Thanks, Li.

187
00:18:02,875 --> 00:18:03,916
When the game console is fixed,

188
00:18:03,916 --> 00:18:04,916
I'll let you play it first.

189
00:18:04,916 --> 00:18:07,091
That's more like it.

190
00:20:28,375 --> 00:20:30,958
You'd better not be a raider.

191
00:20:30,958 --> 00:20:33,800
Otherwise, my good intentions
will have caused a disaster.

192
00:21:22,458 --> 00:21:23,875
Hey! How are you doing?

193
00:21:23,875 --> 00:21:25,300
Hang in there!

194
00:21:32,125 --> 00:21:33,791
Hey! Wake up!

195
00:21:33,791 --> 00:21:35,675
Wake up! Hey!

196
00:21:38,083 --> 00:21:39,833
Hey! Don't die in front me!

197
00:21:39,833 --> 00:21:42,000
I went through a lot to take you back here!

198
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,875
I don't want my efforts to go in vain!

199
00:21:43,875 --> 00:21:46,300
Hey! Wake up!

